# boltverse-odyssey — Grok Build / Cursor

Recipe repo. Not an app. Player is already https://boltverse-odyssey.grok.me

sill ≠ spawn. at-A = already AT the teal LEFT sill (seuil). at-B = already AT the gold RIGHT sill. Spawn = CENTER only. Mid-hall at-A/at-B = FAIL. Soft KEEP banned.

Happy path: clone → read AGENTS.md + GROK.md → Imagine Agent (grok.com/imagine/agent) PRIMARY for BOTH stills AND walk/breath films. ALL hall stills + walks + breaths go through Imagine Agent. Walks = start+end stills (user stills as exact first frame AND last frame, then interpolate). Breaths = same still twice. Director or human drives Agent in the browser until Build has an Agent tool/hook. Smoke still gates.

Chat Imagine UI without Agent is banned for walks / breaths / stills / enter:
imagine_image_to_video, imagine_reference_to_video, imagine_image_to_image
(no last_frame → do not Hang)

Imagine Agent is the PRIMARY cook path for BOTH stills AND films (first+last frames). Not a stills-only restyle footnote.
Imagine Agent is MANDATORY for cross-style hall stills (not optional). Agent REQUIRED for décor variants. One sealed sill still → Agent restyles hall only. cook-room imagineStill = first seal secondary CLI / BANNED for restyle.
Cross-style sealed at-A/at-B: Imagine Agent (grok.com/imagine/agent) — keep exact same dog pose/size/place + same cyan/gold portals; change hall materials only. Sealed skip stays.
Grok Build chat Imagine tools are NOT the same as Imagine Agent. Cross-style sealed stills = Imagine Agent at grok.com/imagine/agent. Build must not use chat imagine_* without Agent. Instruct to open Imagine Agent with the plate refs. Build must not rely on chat imagine_* tools for hall restyle identity lock.
cook-room + imagine-hooks = secondary / CLI only — not the human happy path.
Hung PASS = reuse. --force recooks. Gel-breath / FAIL walk = HANG BLOCKED, not KEEP. Soft KEEP banned. Smoke still gates.
FAIL → packs/<slot>/.kitchen/fail/ (debug). Never stills/films/Hang. at-A/at-B under-size (~0.16–0.21): enlarge-only second step (FAIL jpg = image). Cap 1 fresh + 1 enlarge (or 2 enlarge).
Doors = oval|RECT energy rifts (oval preferred-ok; never wood; never chrome UI). Sit / face / 3/4 / punch-sill (climbing the rift) / mid-hall spawn-cx as at-A/at-B cannot PASS.
No new grok.me. Catalog slots only.
